{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20020","headline":"连州吟 三 · 孟郊","name":"连州吟 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝亦连州吟，暮亦连州吟。\n连州果有信，一纸万里心。\n开缄白云断，明月堕衣襟。\n南风嘶舜琯，苦竹动猿音。\n万里愁一色，潇湘雨淫淫。\n两劒忽相触，双蛟恣浮沈。\n鬬水正回斡，倒流安可禁。\n空愁江海信，惊浪隔相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}